</span><div class="wd-product-grid-slider-pagin"><div data-image-id="0" class="wd-product-grid-slider-dot"></div><div data-image-id="1" class="wd-product-grid-slider-dot"></div><div data-image-id="2" class="wd-product-grid-slider-dot"></div></div></div></div><div class="product-element-bottom"><h3 class="wd-entities-title"><a href="https://litmuskenya.co.ke/product/ubiquiti-nanostation-loco-m5-locom5/">Ubiquiti access point NanoStation Loco M5 (LOCOM5)</a></h3><div class="wd-product-cats">
<a href="https://litmuskenya.co.ke/product-category/networking/" rel="tag">Networking</a>, <a href="https://litmuskenya.co.ke/product-category/networking/access-points/" rel="tag">Access points</a>, <a href="https://litmuskenya.co.ke/product-category/networking/access-points/networking-wireless-links/" rel="tag">Networking wireless links</a>, <a href="https://litmuskenya.co.ke/product-category/networking/access-points/networking-wireless-links/ubiquiti-wireless-links/" rel="tag">Ubiquiti wireless links</a></div><div class="star-rating" role="img" aria-label="Rated 4.63 out of 5">
<span style="width:92.6%">
Rated <strong class="rating">4.63</strong> out of 5		</span></div>
<span class="price"><del aria-hidden="true"><span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount"><bdi><span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol" translate="no" dir="auto">KSh</span>&nbsp;14,000.00</bdi></span></del> <span class="screen-reader-text">Original price was: KSh&nbsp;14,000.00.</span><ins aria-hidden="true"><span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount"><bdi><span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol" translate="no" dir="auto">KSh</span>&nbsp;10,800.00</bdi></span></ins><span class="screen-reader-text">Current price is: KSh&nbsp;10,800.00.</span> <small class="woocommerce-price-suffix">ex VAT</small></span></div></div></div></div></div><div id="wd-371124f5" class="wp-block-wd-collapsible-content wd-effect-fade"><div id="wd-a48c5291" class="wp-block-wd-container wd-dir-col"><h2 id="wd-f72e9bee" class="wp-block-wd-title title">Your tech partner in Nairobi CBD</h2><p id="wd-e05de1e5" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">Then the question arises: where&#8217;s the support? Not there yet? That&#8217;s not so bad, there&#8217;s a salesperson to the rescue. But worse, what if you bought the wrong spec, the router doesn&#8217;t reach the second floor, the UPS can&#8217;t handle the load? Or the price was inflated because you didn&#8217;t know what to ask for, didn&#8217;t understand what you actually needed, or the shop ran out of stock so you settled for &#8220;something close enough&#8221;?</p><p id="wd-20bd89db" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">A customer who walks out confused is a problem. A customer who walks out with the wrong solution because they couldn&#8217;t quite explain what they needed is worse. Chances are there wasn&#8217;t proper consultation, genuine interest in solving the actual problem, there wasn&#8217;t someone who took the time to understand whether you&#8217;re setting up a small office, upgrading a cybercafe, or just need your home Wi-Fi to finally reach the bedroom. It&#8217;s electronics shopping gone wrong right from the start.</p><p id="wd-c1face07" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">But what if it didn&#8217;t have to be that way? How can you shop for computers, networking gear, security systems, and power solutions without feeling lost? No pressure tactics, no confusing jargon, no &#8220;come back tomorrow&#8221; when you need it today, no brands you&#8217;ve never heard of just because they&#8217;re cheaper to stock, all those things that make buying electronics in Nairobi feel like a gamble rather than a straightforward transaction.</p><p id="wd-62852896" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">That&#8217;s why Litmus Kenya exists. Right here in Nairobi CBD, we stock the brands that actually last—<a href="http://dell.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Dell</a>, <a href="http://hp.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">HP</a>, <a href="http://lenovo.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Lenovo</a>, <a href="https://mikrotik.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Mikrotik</a>, <a href="https://www.hikvision.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Hikvision</a>, <a href="https://smartconnect.apc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">APC</a>—and we take the time to understand what you&#8217;re trying to achieve. Whether you&#8217;re a business owner tired of downtime, an IT professional who needs it done right the first time, or someone who just wants their laptop to stop dying mid-presentation, we&#8217;re here to make it work. Fair prices, honest advice, and support that doesn&#8217;t disappear after the sale. Because when your tech works, your business works, and that&#8217;s what matters.</p></div><a id="wd-64b4136d" class="wp-block-wd-button btn btn-style-default btn-color-white btn-size-default btn-shape-round btn-icon-pos-right"><span>Read more</span><div id="wd-1be247f9" class="wp-block-wd-icon"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyNCIgaGVpZ2h0PSIyNCIgdmlld0JveD0iMCAwIDI0IDI0Ij48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwJSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxMDAlIiBzdHlsZT0iZmlsbDojY2ZkNGRiO2ZpbGwtb3BhY2l0eTogMC4xOyIvPjwvc3ZnPg==" decoding="async" width="24" height="24" class="wp-image-478" data-src="https://litmuskenya.co.ke/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/chevron-down-black.svg" alt=""/></div>
</a></div><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p></article></div></main></div><footer class="wd-footer footer-container"><div class="container main-footer wd-entry-content">
